<title>USA: Silicon Valley wins $129 mln order.</title>
<headline>Silicon Valley wins $129 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Valley Group Inc said Monday an unnamed semiconductor maker has ordered 25 of the company's advanced Micrascan lithography systems for about $129 million.</p>
<p>The company said the items, to be delivered over the next two years, will be used for volume production of advanced devices on 200mm wafers.</p>
<p>Silicon Valley Group makes automated wafer processing equipment for semiconductors.</p>
